# The pack payload is a BUILD artifact (4.5.0 Task 2): `python tools/build_asset_packs.py preview`
# places the four `csukuangfj/k2fsa-zipformer-bilingual-zh-en-t` files here from the pinned Hugging
# Face commit (or a local mirror it re-hashes), every byte checked against
# `StreamingPackCatalog.ZH`'s own literals on the way in and re-hashed out of the directory
# afterwards. 50 MB of model must never enter a repo with a public remote, and the root
# .gitignore's blob walls (*.so, *.dlc, *.context, *.bin) do not cover .onnx — so this pattern IS
# the wall. preview_en/.gitignore states the rest of the reasoning once: why the wall is written as
# "everything EXCEPT the anchor" rather than as a list of the four names, why the `.gitkeep` is the
# one TRACKED file here, and why the negation can only re-include a direct child.
src/main/assets/preview_zh/*
!src/main/assets/preview_zh/.gitkeep
